classDiagram
  class Document {
    -State state
    -string content
    +transitionTo(s: State) void
    +edit(text) void
    +submit() void
    +approve() void
    +reject() void
  }
  class State {
    <<interface>>
    +edit(doc, text) void
    +submit(doc) void
    +approve(doc) void
    +reject(doc) void
  }
  class DraftState
  class ModerationState
  class PublishedState
  Document o--> State : estado atual
  State <|.. DraftState
  State <|.. ModerationState
  State <|.. PublishedState
  DraftState ..> ModerationState : submit
  ModerationState ..> PublishedState : approve
  ModerationState ..> DraftState : reject
  PublishedState ..> DraftState : reject
  note for Document "CONTEXT: delega cada operação<br/>ao objeto de estado atual"
